Third-party components
----------------------

This repository takes dependencies on, and in places adapts designs and file formats from,
independently licensed open-source projects. Their licences govern their own code and are
not superseded by this project's licence.

Runtime and library dependencies are declared in `pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`,
`desktop/package.json` and `configs/runtime-sources.env`; each carries its own licence.

Designs, formats or algorithms adapted from other projects are recorded in
`knowledge/research.md` (research waves 6 to 8) with their upstream and licence, and are
noted in the source files that adapt them. At the time of writing this includes:

  * The `apply_patch` edit format, adapted from OpenAI Codex CLI (Apache-2.0).
  * The shadow-repository checkpoint approach, adapted from Cline (Apache-2.0).
  * The tree-sitter/PageRank repository-map approach, adapted from Aider (Apache-2.0).

Model weights are NOT part of this repository and are NOT covered by this licence. Each
model is downloaded from its own upstream under its own terms, recorded in
`configs/models.yaml` and `docs/SOURCES.md`. Some carry non-OSI vendor licences that this
project does not ship in any default install profile; see `knowledge/research.md`
baseline invariant 8 and decisions D-016 and D-017.
